# Development Workflow

## MUST DO BEFORE GIT PUSH
1. Update README.md with changelog entry
2. Run `node generate-version.js`
3. Commit and push to git

## Architecture Constraints
- Hosting: Vercel (NOT Firebase Hosting)
- Database: Firebase Firestore ONLY
- API: Vercel Serverless Functions (/api/)
- Client: app.js is client entry point

## Platform
- Development: Windows (PowerShell)
- Testing: Android (PWA standalone)
